ly reproduced: h = 0.20906030, net(p) = 0.89546985, and 1.1199 * 0.89546985 = 1.002866, so a +11.99% over-bind dressed by net(p) can only give +0.29%. The same +0.12% appears in the .ts authorNotes ('The physical identification B_D approx AME (+0.12%)'); both need the same correction, and the corrected claim is 2.4x weaker than the one now stated.","history":2},{"id":"trap-thesis-restatement","group":"trap","result":"fail","severity":"major","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-21","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:r06","notes":"Proposed (structural — the sentence is math-adjacent, naming (1-h/2), net(p) and the beta-decay sector, so not deleted inline): drop the sentence and let the scope paragraph end on 'The Delta_lambda gate remains the general binding law.' Nothing is lost; if a summary line is wanted, it belongs in .ts authorNotes rather than as a third statement of the claim.","history":2},{"id":"trap-triples","group":"trap","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-21","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:r06","history":2},{"id":"uses-editorial-hygiene","group":"uses","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-10","reviewer":"script","by":"content/pipeline/qa-checkers-uses.ts","history":2},{"id":"uses-formal-coverage","group":"uses","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-10","reviewer":"script","by":"content/pipeline/qa-checkers-uses.ts","history":2},{"id":"voice-agent-speak","group":"voice","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-10","reviewer":"script","by":"content/pipeline/qa-checkers-extended.ts","history":2},{"id":"voice-ai-slop","group":"voice","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-07-19","reviewer":"agent","by":"one-voice-audit","notes":"Agentic heuristic check: pass.","history":3},{"id":"voice-author-notes-poll